# tsc emits .mjs/.cjs and .d.mts/.d.cts beside their .mts/.cts source (packages/README.md build convention: generated output at
# the same relative path). Spec fixtures, templates and generated data keep hand-checked JavaScript: the un-ignores below name
# where a tracked .mjs may still appear.
*.mjs
*.cjs
*.d.mts
*.d.cts
!vendor-types.d.mts
# Spec fixtures are test data; each module a spec imports has a hand-written .d.mts beside it.
!src/fixtures/**
!templates/**
# The vendored yaml bundle and the catalog gen-catalog writes, each with its hand-written types, are tracked as they are.
!runtime/engine/yaml.mjs
!runtime/engine/yaml.d.mts
!runtime/packages/cli/src/catalog.generated.mjs
!runtime/packages/cli/src/catalog.generated.d.mts
